<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Kommunekredit issues 4 pct 2007 bond.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Kommunekredit issues 4 pct 2007 bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Monday by arrangers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p>BORROWER - KOMMUNEKREDIT</p>
<p>AMOUNT - 370 MILLION DANISH CROWNS.</p>
<p>COUPON - FOUR PERCENT</p>
<p>MATURITY - JUNE 6, 2007</p>
<p>ISSUE DATE - JUNE 6 1997</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE - UNSTATED</p>
<p>TYPE - SERIES LOAN, WITH ANNUAL REPAYMENTS OF 37 MILLION</p>
<p>CROWNS, COMMENCING JUNE 8, 1998 AND ENDING JUNE 6, 2007.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
